      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Step-by-Step Moving Day Workflow: Survey, Packing, Transit &amp; Placement for Packers And Movers Lodna Dhanbad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Packers And Movers Lodna Dhanbad, every relocation begins with a meticulous pre‑move assessment. Our experienced team first records a high‑resolution video walkthrough of your home, highlighting fragile items, structural details, and any potential obstacles.</p>
<p>This visual log is complemented by a hands‑on physical survey where we measure doorways, stairwells, and elevators to confirm the route for our trucks. The combined data allows us to create a custom moving plan, identify risk zones, and allocate the right equipment and manpower.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
