    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Each space is treated as a separate project. We start with the kitchen, using padded trays for dishes and insulated containers for perishables. Living rooms receive sturdy cardboard boxes reinforced with corner protectors for electronics and artwork.</p>
