    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Special Handling:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Antique furniture, mirrors, and glassware are wrapped in custom foam and secured with double‑sided tape. Heavy appliances are disassembled, with screws and bolts stored in labeled bags. We also provide a dedicated “fragile” zone in the truck, insulated with rubber mats to absorb shocks.</p>
  </div>
