    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Safe Transit:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">During loading, items are arranged by weight, with heavier pieces at the bottom. We use moving straps and floor rollers to prevent shifting. The truck is equipped with GPS tracking and a temperature‑controlled compartment for sensitive goods. Our drivers follow the pre‑mapped route, minimizing stops and ensuring a smooth ride.</p>
