    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival, we verify the inventory against the packing list. Boxes are systematically unloaded room by room, following the same order as packing. Fragile items are first set aside for careful placement. Once all items are in place, we conduct a quick quality check to ensure no damages occurred during transit.</p>
